{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soul Apocalypto is an RPG that also emphasizes strategic team selection. You can summon various characters to form your own team, and by strategically assigning skills to each companion, you can shape your team's unique traits. Choosing the right companions and configuring their skills effectively is the key to overcoming all challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u4e3b\u9875\u5c55\u793a01.gif?t=1742392508\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u4e3b\u9875\u5c55\u793a02.gif?t=1742392508\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365360?t=1742392508","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742392508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/989c8aa44a95287c7380e752b561f6c3f1459868/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742392508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/989c8aa44a95287c7380e752b561f6c3f1459868/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742392508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3528750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Add to wishlist, and start your soul control journey</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u52a0\u5165\u613f\u671b\u5355\u8bbe\u8ba1\u82f1\u6587.png?t=1742392508\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In \u300aSoul \u2022 Apocalypto\u300b, you will play as Jin Ge. Facing various challenges, you are never alone in the fight. You need to rescue and subdue different creatures on this planet and recruit them. Each creature possesses multiple skills. Choosing the target creature and configuring the skills of your companions are the keys to overcoming every difficulty. The trial version includes the teaching of game operation methods and the content of the first chapter of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use the Soul Forge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat alien monsters, extract their souls, and control their bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u7075\u9b42\u7403\u8bf4\u660e.gif?t=1742392508\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skills of these creatures can be activated and changed at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u6280\u80fd\u8bf4\u660e.gif?t=1742392508\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The front and back rows are the eternal truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different creatures are suitable for different positions. Combine the front and back rows of monsters to form a combat advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u9635\u5bb9\u8bf4\u660e.gif?t=1742392508\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge the Boss of this area</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is our final test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u5173\u5e95\u8bf4\u660e.gif?t=1742392508\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soul Apocalypto is an RPG that also emphasizes strategic team selection. You can summon various characters to form your own team, and by strategically assigning skills to each companion, you can shape your team's unique traits. Choosing the right companions and configuring their skills effectively is the key to overcoming all challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u4e3b\u9875\u5c55\u793a01.gif?t=1742392508\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/\u4e3b\u9875\u5c55\u793a02.gif?t=1742392508\" /></p>","developers":["\u535c\u4e59\u5188(Ploygon)"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/header.jpg?t=1742392508","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"PloyGon- Game Studio All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257075506,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075506/movie480.mp4?t=1739443447","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075506/movie_max.mp4?t=1739443447"},"name":"\u7075\u9b42\u00b7\u542f\u793a\u5f55","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257075506/fc540f19a864f127421de0a2da631ca2687f51b5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739443447","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075506/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739443447","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075506/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739443447"}}],"name":"Soul\u2022Apocalypto","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS